{"game":"Paint","source":"core","apworld":null,"world_version":"0.5.2","groups":[{"name":"Game Options","collapsed":false,"options":[{"key":"progression_balancing","name":"Progression Balancing","kind":"named_range","doc":"A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.\n\nA lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>A system that can move progression earlier, to try and prevent the player from getting stuck and bored early.</p>\n<p>A lower setting means more getting stuck. A higher setting means less getting stuck.</p>\n","min":0,"max":99,"default":50,"special":{"disabled":0,"normal":50,"extreme":99}},{"key":"accessibility","name":"Accessibility","kind":"choice","doc":"Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.\n\n**Full:** ensure everything can be reached and acquired.\n\n**Minimal:** ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Set rules for reachability of your items/locations.</p>\n<p><strong>Full:</strong> ensure everything can be reached and acquired.</p>\n<p><strong>Minimal:</strong> ensure what is needed to reach your goal can be acquired.</p>\n","choices":[{"value":"full","label":"Full","id":0},{"value":"minimal","label":"Minimal","id":2}],"aliases":{"items":"full","locations":"full","none":"minimal"},"default":"full"},{"key":"logic_percent","name":"Logic Percent","kind":"range","doc":"Sets the maximum percent similarity required for a check to be in logic.\nHigher values are more difficult and items/locations will not be generated beyond this number.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":50,"max":95,"default":80},{"key":"goal_percent","name":"Goal Percent","kind":"range","doc":"Sets the percent similarity required to achieve your goal.\nIf this number is higher than the value for logic percent,\nreaching goal will be in logic upon obtaining all progression items.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":50,"max":95,"default":80},{"key":"half_percent_checks","name":"Half Percent Checks","kind":"range","doc":"Sets the lowest percent at which locations will be created for each 0.5% of similarity.\nBelow this number, there will be a check every 1%.\nAbove this number, there will be a check every 0.5%.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":95,"default":50},{"key":"quarter_percent_checks","name":"Quarter Percent Checks","kind":"range","doc":"Sets the lowest percent at which locations will be created for each 0.25% of similarity.\nThis number will override Half Percent Checks if it is lower.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":95,"default":70},{"key":"canvas_size_increment","name":"Canvas Size Increment","kind":"choice","doc":"Sets the number of pixels the canvas will expand for each width/height item received.\nEnsure an adequate number of locations are generated if setting this below 50.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"25","label":"25","id":25},{"value":"50","label":"50","id":50},{"value":"100","label":"100","id":100}],"aliases":{},"default":"100"},{"key":"goal_image","name":"Goal Image","kind":"range","doc":"Sets the numbered image you will be required to match.\nSee https://github.com/MarioManTAW/jspaint/tree/master/images/archipelago\nfor a list of possible images or choose random.\nThis can also be overwritten client-side by using File->Open.","weighted":true,"visibility":0,"min":1,"max":1,"default":1},{"key":"starting_tool","name":"starting_tool","kind":"choice","doc":"Sets which tool (other than Magnifier) you will be able to use from the start.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"choices":[{"value":"brush","label":"Brush","id":0},{"value":"pencil","label":"Pencil","id":1},{"value":"eraser","label":"Eraser","id":2},{"value":"airbrush","label":"Airbrush","id":3},{"value":"line","label":"Line","id":4},{"value":"rectangle","label":"Rectangle","id":5},{"value":"ellipse","label":"Ellipse","id":6},{"value":"rounded_rectangle","label":"Rounded Rectangle","id":7}],"aliases":{},"default":"brush"},{"key":"trap_count","name":"Trap Fill Percent","kind":"range","doc":"Sets the percentage of filler items to be replaced by random traps.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"min":0,"max":100,"default":0},{"key":"death_link","name":"Death Link","kind":"toggle","doc":"If on, using the Undo or Clear Image functions will send a death to all other players with death link on.\nReceiving a death will clear the image and reset the history.\nThis option also prevents Undo and Clear Image traps from being generated in the item pool.","weighted":true,"visibility":15,"default":"false"}]},{"name":"Item & Location Options","collapsed":true,"options":[{"key":"local_items","name":"Local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be in their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be in their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"non_local_items","name":"Non-local Items","kind":"set","doc":"Forces these items to be outside their native world.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Forces these items to be outside their native world.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"start_inventory","name":"Start Inventory","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3} ","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000},{"key":"start_inventory_from_pool","name":"Start Inventory from Pool","kind":"counter","doc":"Start with the specified amount of these items and don't place them in the world. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}\n\nThe game decides what the replacement items will be.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with the specified amount of these items and don't place them in the world. Example: {Bomb: 1, Arrow: 3}</p>\n<p>The game decides what the replacement items will be.</p>\n","default":{},"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","min":null,"max":10000},{"key":"start_hints","name":"Start Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these item's locations prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these item's locations prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"items","name_groups":true},{"key":"start_location_hints","name":"Start Location Hints","kind":"set","doc":"Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the ``!hint`` command.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Start with these locations and their item prefilled into the <tt class=\"docutils literal\">!hint</tt> command.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"exclude_locations","name":"Excluded Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an important item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an important item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"priority_locations","name":"Priority Locations","kind":"set","doc":"Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.","weighted":false,"visibility":15,"doc_html":"<p>Prevent these locations from having an unimportant item.</p>\n","default":[],"valid_keys":[],"key_source":"locations","name_groups":true},{"key":"item_links","name":"Item Links","kind":"plando","doc":"Share part of your item pool with other players.","weighted":false,"visibility":13,"doc_html":"<p>Share part of your item pool with other players.</p>\n","default":[]},{"key":"plando_items","name":"Plando Items","kind":"plando","doc":"Generic items plando.